   "subject": "A little help exporting a graph",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hello,<div><br></div><div>I have exported graphs from ggplot2 using the jpeg format in the past and I have not had any problems. However, I do not understand why I cannot do it now with this case. Probably is something simple, but I cannot realize what exactly is. If someone can give a hand, it would be very appreciated. I am a mac user.</div>\n<div><br></div><div>Paola<br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#0a1d90\">library(<span style=\"color:#000000\">ggplot2</span>)</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#971f16\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> links</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">&lt;-read.table(</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>&quot;/Users/paolabarriga/Desktop/Linksggplot2.txt&quot;<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> sep</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>&quot;\\t&quot;<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> header</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b6882c\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#0a1d90\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>names(<span style=\"color:#000000\">links</span>)</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"> <span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">str(</span>links<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">)</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"> links<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">$</span>group</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"> links<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">$</span>Number_links</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#971f16\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>&quot;as.factor(group)&quot;</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"> <span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">jpeg(</span><span style=\"color:#971f16\">&#39;Links.jpeg&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> widht<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span><span style=\"color:#265020\">7</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> height<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span><span style=\"color:#265020\">7</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> units<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span><span style=\"color:#971f16\">&#39;in&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> res<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span><span style=\"color:#265020\">200</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"> LK<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">&lt;-qplot(</span>Number_links<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span>data<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>links<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span>facets<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>group<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">~</span>.<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> geom<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span><span style=\"color:#971f16\">&quot;histogram&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> binwidth<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span><span style=\"color:#265020\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span> xlim<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=c(</span><span style=\"color:#265020\">0</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span><span style=\"color:#265020\">65</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">))</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#971f16\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> LK</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">LK</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">+labs(</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>&quot;Number of links&quot;<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">=</span>&quot;Frequency&quot;<span style=\"color:#0a1d90\">)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco\"> LK</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:11.0px Monaco;color:#0a1d90\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>dev.off()</p></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>-- <br><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,&#39;new york&#39;,times,serif;font-size:16px\"><div>\nPaola A. Barriga<br>Ph.D. Candidate<br>Department of Biological Sciences<br>SCEN 632<br>1 University of Arkansas<br>Fayetteville, AR 72701-1201<br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">pba...@uark.edu</a><br>\nLab:<a href=\"tel:(479)%20575-6349\" value=\"+14795756349\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(479)575-6349</a><br>___________________________________<br></div><div>&quot;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:14px\">When we face problems or disagreements today, </span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:14px\">we have to arrive at solutions through dialogue. </span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:14px\">Dialogue </span><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:14px\">is the only appropriate method. One-sided </span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:14px\">victory is </span><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:14px\">no longer acceptable. We must work to </span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:14px\">resolve conflicts in a spirit of reconciliation, </span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:14px\">always keeping others&#39; interests in mind.&quot; Dalai Lama</span></div>\n</span><br>\n</div>\n"
